# It's Raining — original story and translation by Claude (Anthropic).
# Target: HSK 3.0 level 1; focus grammar: 了 (change of state), 太……了, days of the week, 今天 / 明天; no names.

@meta {"title_zh": "下雨了", "subtitle_zh": "一个星期的雨", "title_en": "It's Raining", "subtitle_en": "A week of rain", "author": "Text and translation by Claude (Anthropic)"}

@p intro
我|wǒ 家|jiā 有|yǒu 六|liù 口|kǒu 人|rén ： 奶奶|nǎinai 、 爸爸|bàba 、 妈妈|māma 、 哥哥|gēge 、 我|wǒ 和|hé 妹妹|mèimei 。
> There are six people in my family: Grandma, Dad, Mum, my older brother, me and my little sister.
妹妹|mèimei 五|wǔ 岁|suì ， 她|tā 最|zuì 爱|ài 睡觉|shuìjiào 。
> My sister is five, and there's nothing she loves more than sleeping.
